35,2,1,talk,May,,"It seems a few people dominate the room, and the cleaning is totally unfair. One person does all the fridge work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is basically paper; we can hear everything. Plus, everyone is eating at their desks now, leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We are spending a lot of money on small outside rentals, but the internal facilities callouts are surprisingly low.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Those outside rentals are expensive! And the fit-out quotes are quite different depending on what we choose.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,We have no place for private talks. The last awkward conversation happened right in front of everyone. It was terrible.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if we have a kitchen, will the crumbs stay in the break room?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Only if people actually use it instead of their desks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,A dedicated space might save us those outside hire costs Sakura mentioned.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,Exactly! Why pay a company when we have this room?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,But we still need a place to talk without the whole office listening.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"A meeting space would be organized, but would it stop the fridge mess?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"A quiet room would solve the noise, but not the hunger.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must balance the utility with the effort of upkeep.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just don't want us to keep paying monthly for outside rooms!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, wouldn't a meeting space be the best for the team's relationship?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I'm leaning towards something that has a clear rule of use.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,As long as it's not a noisy party zone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,I see the merit in reducing the external travel and cost.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Let's see the final options!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope we pick something that brings us together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
